%U A401252 19,19,19,19,19,19,20,20,20,20,21,21,25,25,25,25,25,25,27,27,28
%N A401252 Number of pairs of coprime positive integers i < j < n with sigma(i) = sigma(j), where sigma is the sum of divisors function.
%C A401252 This is h(n) in Erdős Problem 824.
%H A401252 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A401252/b401252.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%H A401252 Thomas F. Bloom, <a href="https://www.erdosproblems.com/824">Erdős Problem 824</a>, Erdős Problems.
%o A401252 (PARI) a(n) = sum(i=1, n-2, sum(j=i+1, n-1, gcd(i,j)==1 && sigma(i)==sigma(j)));
%Y A401252 Cf. A000203.
%K A401252 nonn,easy,new
%O A401252 1,16
%A A401252 _Seiichi Manyama_, Oct 18 2026
